#. ~ Description of "sauteed onions"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Onions cooked up in oil and spices, often used as a topping or side in "
"dishes."
msgstr ""
"Cebula smażona na oleju z przyprawami, często podawana jako dodatek do potraw"
" lub do posypania."

